---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../../styles/page.css";
---
<Base title="Leave the waitlist · Skovern" description="How to leave the Skovern waitlist and delete your details." noindex>
  <div class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Waitlist</p>
    <h1>Leave the waitlist.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Sorry to see you go. Here's how to delete your details.</p>
    <h2>Use the link in your email</h2>
    <p>Every email from us ends with a link to leave the list. Open it, press <b>Remove me</b>, and we delete your name, email, and answers right away.</p>
    <h2>Can't find the email?</h2>
    <p>Write to <a href="mailto:hi@skovern.com">hi@skovern.com</a> from the address you signed up with. We'll delete your details and tell you when it's done.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="pill line md" href="/">Back to Skovern</a></div>
  </div>
</Base>
